1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,580
When you think of foods that are good for you, chocolate may not be high up on your list.
当你列举有益健康的食物时，巧克力可能不会排在前列。

2
00:00:06,580 --> 00:00:15,310
But, there has been a lot of research into dark chocolate, which shows that it does, in fact, have health benefits.
但针对黑巧克力的大量研究表明，事实上，它其实对健康十分有益。

3
00:00:15,310 --> 00:00:21,130
Chocolate is made by roasting cacao seeds, which come from the cacao tree.
巧克力是由可可树结出的可可豆烘焙制成的。

4
00:00:21,130 --> 00:00:30,860
After being processed into cocoa solids, cocoa butter and combined with sugar and sometimes dairy, chocolate is the result.
可可豆经加工制成可可固形物和可可脂，再加入糖，有时还会添加乳制品，最终就成了巧克力。

5
00:00:30,860 --> 00:00:40,460
To know how dark the chocolate is, and to determine the potential health benefits, we need to look at the level of cocoa solids it contains.
想要判断巧克力的可可含量高低，以及它可能具备的健康益处，我们需要看它所含的可可固形物比例。

6
00:00:40,460 --> 00:00:51,370
If dark chocolate has a high cocoa content, labelled as a percentage, it may be dense in minerals such as magnesium and iron.
如果黑巧克力的可可含量（包装上以百分比标注）较高，那么它就可能富含镁、铁等矿物质。

7
00:00:51,370 --> 00:01:03,980
According to a 2011 study comparing cacao seeds to ‘super fruits’ such as cranberries and pomegranates, dark chocolate may have high levels of antioxidants.
2011年的一项研究将可可豆与蔓越莓、石榴等“超级水果”进行对比，结果发现黑巧克力的抗氧化剂含量可能很高。

8
00:01:03,980 --> 00:01:16,560
Other research includes a 2018 study which found that dark chocolate could significantly reduce inflammation in people with type 2 diabetes.
另有一项2018年的研究表明，黑巧克力能显著减轻2型糖尿病患者的炎症反应。

9
00:01:16,560 --> 00:01:27,500
But companies trying to market dark chocolate as a healthy snack may have a difficult time – the higher the cocoa content, the more bitter the taste.
但企业若想将黑巧克力当作健康零食来推广，可能会面临不小的挑战——可可含量越高，巧克力的味道就越苦。

10
00:01:27,500 --> 00:01:38,560
Plus, commercial dark chocolate tends to be high in calories, saturated fat and can contain significant amounts of sugar.
此外，市售黑巧克力的热量和饱和脂肪含量往往不低，还可能含有大量糖分。

11
00:01:38,560 --> 00:01:49,830
On top of that, during the actual manufacturing process of cleaning, fermenting and roasting the cacao beans, the natural benefits may be lost.
不仅如此，在可可豆清洗、发酵、烘焙的实际生产过程中，其天然有益成分也可能会有所流失。

12
00:01:49,830 --> 00:01:59,660
All in all, it seems that consuming a moderate amount of dark chocolate can’t do you harm – just look for a high cocoa solid percentage!
总而言之，适量食用黑巧克力似乎不会对身体造成伤害——选购时只要认准可可固形物比例高的产品就好！
